        "comments": "The assembly ddEriCine1.hap1.1 is based on 46x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Heterozygous inversions are recorded in this assembly on the following chromosomes: Chromosome 1\n18.05-18.62 Mbp, Chromosome 6\n16.5-17.6 Mbp,\n21.3-21.6 Mbp and Chromosome 7\n6.46-8.04 Mbp.",
